                <pb facs="0357" n="259" xml:id="pg259"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Goodnow to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-07-18"><hi rendition="#italic">July 18,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Bombarding legations 30th June with Krupp cannon. Reliable. Sixty foreigners, 100
                    Chinese massacred Tai-yuan Shansi.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Goodnow.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
